<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>授权进入 - <%= docsTitle %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?v=<%= assetVersion %>" sizes="any">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/styles.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/themes.css?v=<%= assetVersion %>">
</head>
<body class="auth-page">
  <main class="auth-login-card" aria-labelledby="auth-login-title">
    <div class="auth-login-brand">
      <% if (docsLogo) { %>
        <img class="auth-login-logo" src="<%= docsLogo %>" alt="">
      <% } else { %>
        <span class="auth-login-logo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">📚</span>
      <% } %>
      <div>
        <p class="auth-login-eyebrow">LOCAL DOCUMENT CENTER</p>
        <h1 id="auth-login-title"><%= docsTitle %></h1>
        <p><%= docsSubtitle %></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="auth-login-divider"></div>
    <p class="auth-login-description">此文档中心需要授权口令。知道口令即可查看全部文档。</p>
    <form action="/auth/login" method="post" class="auth-form auth-login-form">
      <input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%= nextPath %>">
      <label>
        授权口令
        <input type="password" name="passphrase" autocomplete="current-password" autofocus required>
      </label>
      <% if (error) { %>
        <p class="auth-form-error" role="alert"><%= error %></p>
      <% } %>
      <button type="submit" class="auth-primary-btn">进入文档中心</button>
    </form>
    <p class="auth-login-note">没有账号体系，也没有角色区分；口令是唯一的入口。</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
